hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1649","Narrated to us Bundār, narrated to us ʿUthmān ibn ʿUmar, who said: Ibn Jurayj informed us, from Muḥammad ibn ʿAbbād ibn Jaʿfar, from Abū Salamah ibn Sufyān, from ʿAbd Allāh ibn al-Sāʾib, who said:\n“I was present with the Messenger of Allāh (ﷺ) on the Year of the Conquest. He prayed the dawn prayer, then removed his sandals and placed them to his left.”\n\n**CHAPTER:**"
